IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BXMSGID.

*> External message identity registry (GATE 3).  Durably associates the
*> external identities (MsgId, EndToEndId, protocol version, message
*> family) with the internal operation they produced.  External identity
*> is NOT internal transaction identity: a message is the transport unit;
*> the transaction is the financial unit.  This registry is the seam that
*> makes them traceable without letting callers confuse them.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT MI-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-MI-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS MI-MSGID OF MI-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-MI-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD MI-FILE.
01 MI-REC.
   05 MI-MSGID         PIC X(32).
   05 MI-VER           PIC X(05).
   05 MI-MSGNM         PIC X(20).
   05 MI-E2E           PIC X(32).
   05 MI-FP            PIC X(16).
   05 MI-ENV           PIC X(16).
   05 MI-CHANNEL       PIC X(12).
   05 MI-STATE         PIC X(12).
   05 MI-PIXID         PIC X(12).
   05 MI-TXNID         PIC X(12).
   05 MI-JRNID         PIC X(20).
   05 MI-AMT           PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 MI-CUR           PIC X(03).
   05 MI-CREATED       PIC 9(14).
   05 MI-UPDATED       PIC 9(14).
   05 MI-COUNT         PIC 9(03).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-MI-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-MI-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKMIDP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-MSGID-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO MD-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO MD-MSG
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-MI-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/bndmsgid.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-MI-PATH
    PERFORM OPEN-STORE
    IF MD-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(MD-OP)
        WHEN "IDM-BEGIN" PERFORM DO-BEGIN
        WHEN "IDM-GET" PERFORM DO-GET
        WHEN "IDM-COMPLETE" PERFORM DO-COMPLETE
        WHEN "IDM-FAIL" PERFORM DO-FAIL
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO MD-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN MESSAGE IDENTITY OP" TO MD-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    CLOSE MI-FILE
    GOBACK.

OPEN-STORE.
    OPEN I-O MI-FILE
    IF WS-MI-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT MI-FILE
        CLOSE MI-FILE
        OPEN I-O MI-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-MI-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-MI-ST TO MD-RC
        MOVE "CANNOT OPEN MESSAGE IDENTITY STORE" TO MD-MSG
    END-IF.

DO-BEGIN.
    MOVE MD-MSG-ID TO MI-MSGID OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-VER TO MI-VER OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-FAMILY TO MI-MSGNM OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-E2E TO MI-E2E OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-FP TO MI-FP OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-ENV TO MI-ENV OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-CHANNEL TO MI-CHANNEL OF MI-REC
    MOVE "RECEIVED" TO MI-STATE OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-AMOUNT TO MI-AMT OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-CURRENCY TO MI-CUR OF MI-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MI-CREATED OF MI-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MI-UPDATED OF MI-REC
    MOVE 0 TO MI-COUNT OF MI-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO MI-PIXID OF MI-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO MI-TXNID OF MI-REC
    MOVE SPACES TO MI-JRNID OF MI-REC
    WRITE MI-REC
        INVALID KEY MOVE "22" TO MD-RC
    END-WRITE
    IF MD-RC = "22"
        PERFORM DO-GET
        IF MI-STATE OF MI-REC NOT = "RECEIVED"
            MOVE "22" TO MD-RC
        END-IF
    END-IF.

DO-GET.
    MOVE MD-MSG-ID TO MI-MSGID OF MI-REC
    READ MI-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "23" TO MD-RC
            MOVE "MESSAGE IDENTITY NOT FOUND" TO MD-MSG
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-READ
    MOVE MI-VER OF MI-REC TO MD-VER
    MOVE MI-MSGNM OF MI-REC TO MD-FAMILY
    MOVE MI-E2E OF MI-REC TO MD-E2E
    MOVE MI-FP OF MI-REC TO MD-FP
    MOVE MI-ENV OF MI-REC TO MD-ENV
    MOVE MI-STATE OF MI-REC TO MD-STATE
    MOVE MI-PIXID OF MI-REC TO MD-PIX
    MOVE MI-TXNID OF MI-REC TO MD-TXN
    MOVE MI-JRNID OF MI-REC TO MD-JRN
    MOVE MI-COUNT OF MI-REC TO MD-CNT
    MOVE "00" TO MD-RC.

DO-COMPLETE.
    MOVE MD-MSG-ID TO MI-MSGID OF MI-REC
    READ MI-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "23" TO MD-RC
            MOVE "MESSAGE IDENTITY NOT FOUND" TO MD-MSG
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-READ
    MOVE MD-STATE TO MI-STATE OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-PIX TO MI-PIXID OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-TXN TO MI-TXNID OF MI-REC
    MOVE MD-JRN TO MI-JRNID OF MI-REC
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MI-UPDATED OF MI-REC
    ADD 1 TO MI-COUNT OF MI-REC
    REWRITE MI-REC
        INVALID KEY MOVE "20" TO MD-RC
    END-REWRITE.

DO-FAIL.
    MOVE MD-MSG-ID TO MI-MSGID OF MI-REC
    READ MI-FILE
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE "23" TO MD-RC
            EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-READ
    IF MD-STATE NOT = SPACES
        MOVE MD-STATE TO MI-STATE OF MI-REC
    ELSE
        MOVE "FAILED" TO MI-STATE OF MI-REC
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-NOW(1:14) TO MI-UPDATED OF MI-REC
    ADD 1 TO MI-COUNT OF MI-REC
    REWRITE MI-REC
        INVALID KEY MOVE "20" TO MD-RC
    END-REWRITE.
